25:["$","p","Holiday dates for festivals such as Diwali, Holi",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Holiday dates for festivals such as Diwali, Holi, Eid and Dussehra depend on the lunar calendar and are announced by the government each year, so dates for future years may be updated later."}]
