28:["$","div","National, gazetted and restricted holidays",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"National, gazetted and restricted holidays"}],[["$","p","Three days are national holidays observed across",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Three days are national holidays observed across India: Republic Day on 26 January, Independence Day on 15 August and Gandhi Jayanti on 2 October. In addition, the central government notifies a list of gazetted holidays for festivals such as Holi, Diwali, Good Friday, Id-ul-Fitr and Christmas."}],["$","p","Central government employees can also take a lim",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Central government employees can also take a limited number of restricted holidays from a notified list. State governments publish their own holiday lists, which often add regional festivals like Pongal, Onam, Bihu or Ganesh Chaturthi."}]],null,null]}]
29:["$","div","Bank holidays and business planning",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Bank holidays and business planning"}],[["$","p","Bank holidays follow the RBI’s calendar and diff",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Bank holidays follow the RBI’s calendar and differ by state. Banks are also closed on the second and fourth Saturdays and on Sundays. Online banking and UPI remain available, but cheque clearing, branch work and some NEFT-linked settlements can be affected, so plan payments before a holiday cluster."}],["$","p","For businesses, check the holiday list when you ",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"For businesses, check the holiday list when you set delivery dates, payroll dates and GST or TDS due dates, because filing deadlines that fall on a holiday may move to the next working day."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Plan salary and vendor payments before a run of holidays",{"children":"Plan salary and vendor payments before a run of holidays"}],["$","li","Confirm state-specific holidays for offices in several states",{"children":"Confirm state-specific holidays for offices in several states"}],["$","li","Check the RBI list for exact bank closures in your state",{"children":"Check the RBI list for exact bank closures in your state"}]]}],null]}]
2a:["$","div","Planning long weekends",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Planning long weekends"}],[["$","p","A holiday on a Friday or Monday creates a three-",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"A holiday on a Friday or Monday creates a three-day weekend, and one on a Tuesday or Thursday may be worth bridging with a single day of leave. Book trains and hotels early for such dates, since prices and demand rise sharply."}]],null,null]}]
2b:["$","div","Why festival dates change every year",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Why festival dates change every year"}],[["$","p","India follows the Gregorian calendar for civil d",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"India follows the Gregorian calendar for civil dates, but many festivals follow lunar or lunisolar calendars. Diwali, Holi, Dussehra, Raksha Bandhan and Janmashtami are tied to the Hindu lunisolar calendar and the position of the moon, which is why they fall on different dates each year. Eid and Muharram follow the Islamic lunar calendar, which is about 11 days shorter than the solar year, so they move earlier every year. Fixed-date holidays such as Republic Day, Independence Day, Gandhi Jayanti and Christmas stay on the same date."}],["$","p","For moon-based festivals, the final date can als",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"For moon-based festivals, the final date can also depend on the sighting of the moon, so the government may confirm it only a few days before. That is why a holiday can shift by a day from an early estimate."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Fixed dates: 26 January, 15 August, 2 October, 25 December",{"children":"Fixed dates: 26 January, 15 August, 2 October, 25 December"}],["$","li","Lunar festivals: Diwali, Holi, Dussehra, Eid, Muharram and others move every year",{"children":"Lunar festivals: Diwali, Holi, Dussehra, Eid, Muharram and others move every year"}],["$","li","Moon-sighting festivals can be confirmed late",{"children":"Moon-sighting festivals can be confirmed late"}]]}],null]}]
2c:["$","div","Holidays for employees, students and businesses",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Holidays for employees, students and businesses"}],[["$","p","Employees should check the holiday list in their",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Employees should check the holiday list in their offer letter or company policy, because private companies choose their own list, often based on the central or state calendar. Some companies give optional or floating holidays that you can pick from a list for festivals you celebrate."}],["$","p","Students should check the school or university c",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Students should check the school or university calendar, which can add days such as foundation day or exam breaks. Businesses should remember that banks, courts, government offices and stock exchanges each follow their own holiday lists, so check the specific notice before you plan a payment, a filing or a hearing."}]],null,null]}]
2d:["$","div","Central and state holidays",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Central and state holidays"}],[["$","p","The list on this page covers central government ",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"The list on this page covers central government holidays. State governments add holidays such as regional new years, harvest festivals and the birth anniversaries of local leaders, and some national festivals are not holidays in every state. For exact dates for your state, check your state government’s notification or your employer’s calendar."}]],null,null]}]
